# TNT fuses keep burning past the TNT budget (HorizonsX f4745816d, Rust Paper a659a6629, 2026-11-07): the
# budget counted the wait between ticks (TNT always got the 2 ms least) and TNT past max-tnt-per-tick had its
# fuse frozen, so 8,000 TNT went off ~50 a second for minutes after the field looked done. Now every fuse burns
# every tick (past the budget without moving), due TNT waits to explode (max-tnt-per-tick counts explosions)
# and waiting TNT is not pushed. Cube: 160+ s -> ~10 s. Made like zz_tnt_engine.py, applied after it.
